      "message": "Hi Jett:\nPlease refer https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/master/common/gpio.c#78. When enable is 1 in gpio_config_pins(), af-\u003eflags is chosen as flags parameter in gpio_set_flags_by_mask(). In npcx gpio driver (https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/master/chip/npcx/gpio.c#244), it doesn\u0027t refer GPIO_INPUT flag here. But I still think keeping flags field between structure gpio_info and gpio_alt_func as the same is better in case unexpected symptom occurred in the future.\n\nPs. I also modified the commit message for better explnantion.",
